settings-dependencies = Dependencies and Safety
settings-empty-guidance = Use Add to create an Online mount or Offline mirror. Existing legacy systemd user services can be imported separately.
settings-add-guidance = Choose a provider, access mode, remote or subtree, local target, dependency checks, VPN readiness, and confirmation policy. The final creation step will require confirmation before writing configuration or units.
settings-import-guidance = Scan ~/.config/systemd/user for compatible rclone and onedriver services, preview what can be imported, preserve originals by default, and confirm any applet-owned replacement before writing files.
